        "body": "Alabama's federal contract obligations are $113M for FY2027 to date. Obligations are down 99.3% year over year. Prior fiscal years show much higher totals, with FY26 at $17.2B and FY25 at $18.1B. The drop in FY2027 to date contrasts with the multi-year trend that peaked at $18.1B in FY25."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are the major buyers and contractors in Alabama right now?",
